Key layout: Kedmanee (Thai Industrial Standard TIS 820-2538), as xkeyboard-config's symbols/th gives it (https://gitlab.freedesktop.org/xkeyboard-config/xkeyboard-config), with the keys the Titan doesn't have held on its letter keys.

Words: PyThaiNLP's corpus (https://github.com/PyThaiNLP/pythainlp), via HeliBoard's aosp-dictionaries (main_th.combined), CC0 1.0.
